        "TileImage": "$($repository 0f54b455-61c7-44de-a2cb-582accb943b3).Image",
        "Description": "It seems as if Manny Russo from the grave continues to taunt you. A dead man&apos;s switch, sending his money to his partners in crime, Owen Chambers and Augusto Albarez. Chambers is set to take over the Goldberg firm and continue to traffic thousands of fake bills through &quot;legitimate&quot; means.\r\rTake out Goldberg&apos;s newest proprietors, as well as their personal guards, keeping watch from a distance to prevent any further suspicion. Do also take the planned head of security, Elija Bravo.\r\r####",
